{"headword":"יוֹאֵל","parent_lexicon":"BDB Dictionary","content":{"senses":[{"definition":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">יוֹאֵל</span></big> <strong>n.pr.m.</strong> 𝔊 Ἰωηλ <strong>(</strong>usually interpr. as <span dir=\"rtl\">י׳</span> <em>is God</em>, cf. <span dir=\"rtl\">אֵלִיָּהוּ</span>; but Ph. <span dir=\"rtl\">יאל</span> … CIS <sup>i. 132 l. 4</sup> & in <span dir=\"rtl\">יאלפעל</span> (Louvre) appar. n.pr. dei, perhaps = <em>Iolaos</em>, CIS <sup>i. p. 163</sup> & reff.; v. also Nes<sup>Eg 86</sup> RS<sup>K 301</sup>; Nes <em>strong-willed</em>, cf. <span dir=\"rtl\">ויל</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">ואל</span> Sin. Inscr. <span dir=\"rtl\">وائل</span>, v. <span dir=\"rtl\">ואלו</span> Eut<sup>Sin.Inschr. No. 5 + often</sup>, yet cf. Dr<sup>Stud. Bib. i. 5 n.</sup>; W in RS<sup>l.c.</sup> proposes connex. with Arabic <em>Wâil</em> in n.pr. trib. Bakr Wâil (√ <span dir=\"rtl\">وَأَلَ</span> <em>take refuge</em>) cf. RS<sup>K</sup> 194<strong>)</strong>—<br/>"},{"senses":[{"definition":"Samuel’s first-born <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 8:2\" href=\"/I_Samuel.8.2\">1 S 8:2</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 6:18\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.6.18\">1 Ch 6:18</a>; ins. also v <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 6:13\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.6.13\">13</a> after 𝔊L Ἰωηλ (cf. Dr <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 8:2\" href=\"/I_Samuel.8.2\">1 S 8:2</a>).<br/>"}],"num":"1."},{"senses":[{"definition":"a Simeonite prince <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 4:35\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.4.35\">1 Ch 4:35</a>.<br/>"}],"num":"2."},{"senses":[{"definition":"a Reubenite <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 5:4\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.5.4\">1 Ch 5:4</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 5:8\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.5.8\">8</a>.<br/>"}],"num":"3."},{"senses":[{"definition":"a Gadite chief <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 5:12\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.5.12\">1 Ch 5:12</a>.<br/>"}],"num":"4."},{"senses":[{"definition":"a chief man of Issachar <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 7:3\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.7.3\">1 Ch 7:3</a>.<br/>"}],"num":"5."},{"senses":[{"definition":"one of David’s heroes <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 11:38\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.11.38\">1 Ch 11:38</a>.<br/>"}],"num":"6."},{"senses":[{"definition":"a chief of Manasseh <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 27:20\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.27.20\">1 Ch 27:20</a>.<br/>"}],"num":"7."},{"senses":[{"definition":"a Jew of Ezra’s time <a data-ref=\"Ezra 10:43\" href=\"/Ezra.10.43\">Ezr 10:43</a>.<br/>"}],"num":"8."},{"senses":[{"definition":"a Benjamite <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 11:9\" href=\"/Nehemiah.11.9\">Ne 11:9</a>."}],"num":"9."},{"senses":[{"definition":"the prophet, son of Pethuel <a data-ref=\"Joel 1:1\" href=\"/Joel.1.1\">Jo 1:1</a>."}],"num":"10."},{"senses":[{"definition":"Levites"},{"senses":[{"definition":"<a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 6:21\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.6.21\">1 Ch 6:21</a>;"}],"num":"a."},{"senses":[{"definition":"<a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 29:12\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.29.12\">2 Ch 29:12</a>;"}],"num":"b."},{"senses":[{"definition":"<a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 15:7\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.15.7\">1 Ch 15:7</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 15:11\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.15.11\">11</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 15:17\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.15.17\">17</a>, perhaps ="}],"num":"c."},{"senses":[{"definition":"<a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 23:8\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.23.8\">1 Ch 23:8</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 26:22\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.26.22\">26:22</a>."}],"num":"d."}],"num":"11."}]},"rid":"BDB02354","strong_numbers":["3100"],"next_hw":"יוֹאָשׁ","prev_hw":"יוֹאָחָז","all_cited":true,"quotes":[],"GK":["3408"],"TWOT":[],"parent_lexicon_details":{"name":"BDB Dictionary","language":"heb.biblical","to_language":"eng","text_categories":[],"source":"BDB Dictionary","attribution":"F. Brown, S. Driver & C. Briggs","index_title":"BDB","version_title":"A Hebrew and English lexicon of the Old Testament, by Francis Brown. With the co-operation of S. R. Driver and Charles A. Briggs. Oxford, 1906","version_lang":"en","should_autocomplete":true}}